&lt;p style="margin-left: 180px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;株式会社Next Solution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 180px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;Money Forward America&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 180px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;HIRAC FUND２号投資事業有限責任組合&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 180px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;Money Forward India Private Limited&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 168px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 72px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;
当連結会計年度より、Money Forward India Private Limitedを新たに設立したため、連結の範囲に含めております。
&lt;/p&gt;
